    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this top floor, two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment designed and finished to an excellent standard, located on Waterloo Road, in the heart of Ballsbridge. This dual aspect apartment is situated in a period Victorian residence which has been modernised and refurbished in recent years. The property briefly comprises a spacious living/kitchen/dining, two generous double bedroom and a modern bathroom with electric shower. The apartment enjoys views over the front of the property and the tree lined avenues of Dublin 4.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nWaterloo Road in leafy Ballsbridge enjoys an unrivalled location on the doorstep of the Baggott Street and the Grand Canal. It is convenient to a selection of restaurants, cafés, bars and shops and amenities. The Aviva Stadium is a short walk away and other nearby amenities include Trinity College, the National Concert Hall, the Iveagh Gardens and Merrion Square. Transport links include a Dublin Bike stand at Baggot Street Bridge, a bus corridor on Northumberland Road and a DART station at Lansdowne Road."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
