        "Content": "Available immediately.\r\nFully furnished.\r\nDual aspect with views over the city.\r\nTop floor setting.\r\nLarge double bedrooms.\r\nContemporary bathroom with electric shower.\r\nOn the doorstep of Baggot Street.\r\n10 minute walk to Herbert Park.\r\n15 minute walk to St Stephen’s Green."
      },
